<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A2.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Timings of the CUDA implementation of parallel reduction, for diagonal (left) and <math id="A2.F7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\times 2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\times 2</annotation></semantics></math> block-diagonal (right) Jacobians, varying its chunk_size hyperparameter <math id="A2.F7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math>. Timings for Mamba implementation of parallel_scan are also reported as reference.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
