<figure id="A3.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Scale-specific training configurations on nodes with 8 NVIDIA H100 GPUs each All models use 2048-token sequences and follow (<math id="A3.T4.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\sim 1\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em">×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim 1\times</annotation></semantics></math>) Chinchilla-optimal token budgets <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hoffmann et al., 2022</a>)</cite> for batch-size selection. The z-loss regularization coefficient is taken from DCLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Li et al., 2024</a>)</cite>.</figcaption>
