<p id="A4.SS3.p3.4" class="ltx_p">The final ingredient to be able to start using the class, is prescribing its action <a href="#S3.E1.1" title="In Equation 3.1 ‣ RNN Cell Definitions ‣ 3 Adapting GRU and LSTM for ParaRNN ‣ ParaRNN: Unlocking Parallel Training ofNonlinear RNNs for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.1a</span></a>:</p>
